l115: $ G , tk = k ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ vt = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons z ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_clift k p z ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift k d a b ∈ lrel , l ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) ty w ⇒ p ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [l24]
