l124: $ … ⇒ esat u (dsh u M (scat m s)) vt w = esat u (dsh u M s) ty w $ by ex_elim [l123, l122]
l125: $ G , ∃ a ∃ b ∃ p ∃ z (tk = k ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ vt = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons z ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_clift k p z ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift k d a b ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b ∃ p ∃ z (tk = k ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ vt = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons z ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_clift k p z ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift k d a b ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l126: $ … ⇒ esat u (dsh u M (scat m s)) vt w = esat u (dsh u M s) ty w $ by ex_elim [l125, l124]
l127: $ G , ∃ d ∃ a ∃ b ∃ p ∃ z (tk = k ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ vt = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons z ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_clift k p z ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift k d a b ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ d ∃ a ∃ b ∃ p ∃ z (tk = k ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ vt = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons z ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_clift k p z ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift k d a b ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l128: $ … ⇒ esat u (dsh u M (scat m s)) vt w = esat u (dsh u M s) ty w $ by ex_elim [l127, l126]
l129: $ G , ∃ k ∃ d ∃ a ∃ b ∃ p ∃ z (tk = k ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ vt = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons z ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_clift k p z ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift k d a b ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ d ∃ a ∃ b ∃ p ∃ z (tk = k ∧ ty = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ vt = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons z ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_clift k p z ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen p d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift k d a b ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l130: $ … ⇒ esat u (dsh u M (scat m s)) vt w = esat u (dsh u M s) ty w $ by ex_elim [l129, l128]
