lemma fci2_all (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w p s s2 tk: set): $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk $
----
l1: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk $ by ax
l2: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by ax
l3: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by ax
l4: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
l5: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by ax
l6: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ p ∊ fseq u $ by ax
l7: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by ax
l8: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ s2 ∊ fseq u $ by ax
l9: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ cdm p = fv nvf tk $ by ax
l10: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel $ by ax
l11: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel $ by ax
l12: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_clen y q ∈ lrel $ by ax
l13: $ G , i ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ fci2_q M u w p s s2 tk , y = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ lvals , p ∊ fseq u , s ∊ fseq u , s2 ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf tk , ra_closed tk t ∈ lrel , ra_pis y b t ∈ lrel , ra_clen y q ∈ lrel ⇒ esat u (dsh u M (scat p s)) y w = esat u (dsh u M (scat p s2)) y w $ by fci2_n [l1, l2, l3, l4, l5, l6, l7, l8, l9, l10, l11, l12]
